    "detailed_description": "&quot;EnGaCho&quot; is an arcade-style  side-scrolling action game where you advance while defeating enemies and earning money.<br>The main character &quot;EnGaCho'' goes on a journey to defeat the evil nouveau riche and help the people who are suffering from poverty...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810380/extras/3b50c8d1e74305306d51debbddeb4ede.avif?t=1710173857\" width=466 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When you are in trouble, money will solve the problem!</h2>EnGaCho's journey will be tough. You should use the money you earn to power up EnGaCho.<br>It is up to the player to decide whether to be aggressive or focus on durability.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >100 stages in total!</h2>However, that doesn't mean you have to clear everything. There are many warp zones within the stages.<br>You can attack the final boss using the shortest route, or you can work hard to earn a score. Again, it's up to the player.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810380/extras/617f87c050b1d1ac4399febea871e81a.avif?t=1710173857\" width=466 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Don't miss the power-up items scattered throughout the stage.<br></li><li>Once you cleared a stage, you can play it as much as you like in Practice mode.<br></li><li>If you save money instead of spending it, you can get more money and score.<br></li><li>Also check out the SHOP on the title scene.<br></li><li>Boss battles should be fought with proper countermeasures.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810380/extras/0a04b41c9c774b2c31d5c6f02769c9aa.avif?t=1710173857\" width=466 height=80 /></span><br><br>Make full use of all options and grab glory!",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;EnGaCho&quot; is an arcade-style  side-scrolling action game where you advance while defeating enemies and earning money.<br>The main character &quot;EnGaCho'' goes on a journey to defeat the evil nouveau riche and help the people who are suffering from poverty...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810380/extras/3b50c8d1e74305306d51debbddeb4ede.avif?t=1710173857\" width=466 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When you are in trouble, money will solve the problem!</h2>EnGaCho's journey will be tough. You should use the money you earn to power up EnGaCho.<br>It is up to the player to decide whether to be aggressive or focus on durability.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >100 stages in total!</h2>However, that doesn't mean you have to clear everything. There are many warp zones within the stages.<br>You can attack the final boss using the shortest route, or you can work hard to earn a score. Again, it's up to the player.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810380/extras/617f87c050b1d1ac4399febea871e81a.avif?t=1710173857\" width=466 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Don't miss the power-up items scattered throughout the stage.<br></li><li>Once you cleared a stage, you can play it as much as you like in Practice mode.<br></li><li>If you save money instead of spending it, you can get more money and score.<br></li><li>Also check out the SHOP on the title scene.<br></li><li>Boss battles should be fought with proper countermeasures.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810380/extras/0a04b41c9c774b2c31d5c6f02769c9aa.avif?t=1710173857\" width=466 height=80 /></span><br><br>Make full use of all options and grab glory!",
